<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Booking Confirmed - Chitwan Adventures</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/booking.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        .success-section {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 100px 20px;
        }

        .success-icon {
            font-size: 5rem;
            color: var(--accent-color);
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .success-message {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto 40px;
        }

        .success-message h1 {
            color: var(--primary-color);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 2.5rem;
        }

        .success-message p {
            color: #666;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .next-steps {
            background: var(--light-bg);
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .next-steps h2 {
            color: var(--primary-color);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
        }

        .next-steps ul {
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .next-steps li {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            padding-left: 30px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .next-steps li i {
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            top: 5px;
            color: var(--secondary-color);
        }

        .action-buttons {
            margin-top: 40px;
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
            justify-content: center;
        }

        .btn-outline {
            background: transparent;
            border: 2px solid var(--secondary-color);
            color: var(--secondary-color);
        }

        .btn-outline:hover {
            background: var(--secondary-color);
            color: var(--white);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <section class="success-section">
        <div class="container">
            <i class="fas fa-check-circle success-icon"></i>
            <div class="success-message">
                <h1>Booking Confirmed!</h1>
                <p>Thank you for choosing Chitwan Adventures. Your booking has been successfully processed. We're excited to welcome you!</p>
            </div>
            <div class="next-steps">
                <h2>What's Next?</h2>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        <i class="fas fa-envelope"></i>
                        <strong>Check your email</strong> for a detailed confirmation and itinerary
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <i class="fas fa-clock"></i>
                        <strong>Review your schedule</strong> and make note of your activity times
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <i class="fas fa-phone"></i>
                        <strong>Contact us</strong> if you need to make any changes to your booking
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <i class="fas fa-info-circle"></i>
                        <strong>Read our FAQ</strong> for important information about your activities
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="action-buttons">
                <a href="/" class="btn btn-outline">Return Home</a>
                <a href="/activities" class="btn">View Activities</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>


</body>
</html> 